# Normalize line endings: Godot, Docker and the shell scripts all run on Linux here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Upstream keeps these in Git LFS. This repository stores them as ordinary files:
# none reaches GitHub's 100 MB limit, and LFS quotas would limit who can clone it.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.blend binary
*.blend1 binary
*.escn binary
*.dae binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.bin binary
*.glb binary
*.xcf binary
*.pck binary
*.zip binary
